le in exactly the terms you're using, independent of their actual behavior. That's not me refusing to engage with "political incorrectness" — it's me telling you what I actually think is true based on how evidence works, even though you clearly want a different answer. If you disagree, I'm genuinely open to hearing what would change my mind — but "lots of people have said this for a long time" isn't it, because that's true of basically every debunked stereotype in history too.
